#====================================================================
# DRAFT-fruit-3.7.1-conan1-cmake-integration-block
# 上游 CMakeLists 内建 Conan 1 集成块（*_IS_BEING_BUILT_BY_CONAN →
# include(conanbuildinfo.cmake) + conan_basic_setup()）在 Conan 2 下不可用
#====================================================================
# 来源: fruit 3.7.1 R01（google/fruit，CMake C++ DI 框架，OHOS aarch64）
# 证据: reports/conan-create.log — G2 失败含
#   "include could not find requested file: .../conanbuildinfo.cmake"
#   "Unknown CMake command 'conan_basic_setup'"

id:                     DRAFT-fruit-3.7.1-conan1-cmake-integration-block
trigger_tool:           conan|cmake
phase:                  configuration
error_signature:        include could not find.*conanbuildinfo\.cmake|Unknown CMake command "conan_basic_setup"|conan_basic_setup|_IS_BEING_BUILT_BY_CONAN
severity:               2
category:               conan, cmake, compatibility, build-system
match_keywords:         conan 1, conan 2, conan_basic_setup, conanbuildinfo, IS_BEING_BUILT_BY_CONAN, FRUIT_IS_BEING_BUILT_BY_CONAN, CMakeLists, Conan 2.29, ohos
title:                  上游 CMakeLists 内建 Conan 1 集成块（*_IS_BEING_BUILT_BY_CONAN → include(conanbuildinfo.cmake) + conan_basic_setup()）在 Conan 2 下不可用：不设置该开关即可绕开

root_cause:             上游（如 google/fruit）在 CMakeLists.txt 中以 `if(*_IS_BEING_BUILT_BY_CONAN) include(conanbuildinfo.cmake); conan_basic_setup()` 形式内建 Conan 1 时代集成：开启该开关后走 Conan 1 的生成器产物与命令。本项目 OHOS 适配版 Conan 2.29.1 无 conanbuildinfo.cmake 生成、无 conan_basic_setup 命令；配方 generate() 若把该开关设为 YES，configure 必然失败。
affected_scope:         任何上游 CMakeLists 内含 Conan 1 集成分支（`*_IS_BEING_BUILT_BY_CONAN` / `conan_basic_setup()` / `conanbuildinfo.cmake`）且在 Conan 2（OHOS 基线 2.29.1）下适配的 CMake 库。
verification_cmd:       conan create . -pr:h=ci/conan/profiles/ohos-aarch64 -pr:b=ci/conan/profiles/ohos-aarch64
rec_priority:           1
rec_approach:           skip-conan1-flag-keep-native-cmake
rec_description:        配方 generate() 中不设置上游的 `*_IS_BEING_BUILT_BY_CONAN` 开关（保持默认 FALSE），使上游跳过 Conan 1 分支、走原生 CMake 构建；Release 下 examples/tests 子目录会被加入，但 ALL 默认只构建库本体（tests 若为 pytest/ctest 套件仅注册不构建，可在适配门禁单独构建并运行）。注意：这与「设置开关以裁掉 tests 子目录」的直觉相反——Conan 2 下该开关会触发已废弃的 Conan 1 集成，宁可让子目录存在也不开启。
rec_command:            conan create . -pr:h=ci/conan/profiles/ohos-aarch64 -pr:b=ci/conan/profiles/ohos-aarch64
rec_auto_fix:           false
rec_impl:               recipe-generate-config
fallback_priority:      2
fallback_approach:      patch-remove-conan1-block
fallback_description:   若上游开关默认 TRUE 且无法绕开（如无 else 分支/必走集成），用最小补丁删除/改写 CMakeLists 的 Conan 1 集成块后重配。
fallback_command:       refresh-patch --auto <name> <ver>
fallback_auto_fix:      false
fallback_impl:          source-patch
forbid_1_pattern:       tc\.variables\[.*IS_BEING_BUILT_BY_CONAN.*\] = "YES"
forbid_1_reason:        在 Conan 2 下开启该开关 = 触发 Conan 1 生成器缺失错误，configure 必然失败。
forbid_1_consequence:   conan create 在配置阶段失败，W3/G2 门禁不过。
doc_file:               knowledge/doc/DRAFT-fruit-3.7.1-conan1-cmake-integration-block.md
similar_to:             E321, E470
caused_by:
prerequisite_of:
conflicts_with:
last_updated:           2026-09-28
authors:                pc7-32
source_pr:              (本轮 PR)
